    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="social-media-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-top: 20px;">
    
    <!-- TikTok -->
    <div class="social-card" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 35px 24px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
      <div style="font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;">🎵</div>
      <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 22px; color: var(--navy-dark); margin-bottom: 10px;">TikTok</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--slate-gray); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.5; flex-grow: 1;">
        Watch viral canine summer safety hacks, hot-pavement 5-second tests, and science-backed evaporative cooling tips.
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@dogfriz123" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none;">@dogfriz123</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Instagram -->
    <div class="social-card" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 35px 24px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
